--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Kenney game assets — https://kenney.nl — CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The ground tilesets, block and enemy sprites, item icons and decoration
sprites under public/assets/ derive from Kenney's "Pixel Platformer" pack,
composited to this project's tile sizes by scripts/prepare-kenney-assets.py.

CC0 places the work in the public domain and requires no attribution. It is
given here because it is deserved, not because it is owed.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Original to this project
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The sound effects (public/assets/audio/sfx/) are synthesised outright by
scripts/generate-sfx.py and are covered by the MIT licence above, not by any
third party's terms.

The player character art, the painted level backgrounds
(scripts/generate-painted-backgrounds.py), the castle tileset's stone and lava
frames and all UI chrome (src/assets/generateTextures.ts) are likewise this
project's own.

The home-page music track (public/assets/audio/menu-theme.mp3) was supplied by
the project owner.
